# Tomik's cap is an ability granted to the planeswalker, and layer 6 applies in timestamp order (CR 613.1f, 613.7): a
# "loses all abilities" older than the grant leaves the planeswalker the granted ability. Bot1's Flourishing Grapple strips
# Wrenn and Six of all abilities first; only then does Bot2 flicker Tomik with Ephemerate, so the grant comes after the loss
# and Wrenn is capped at one attacker all the same: the declaration naming both creatures at Wrenn is refused. (With the
# loss newer than the grant, see tomik-does-not-cap-a-planeswalker-that-lost-its-abilities.) Wrenn takes 2 from the
# Changeling and ends at 1 loyalty; Ornithopter attacks Bot2 instead.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Woodland Changeling
Ornithopter
Forest
Flourishing Grapple
Swamp
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Tomik, Orzhov Lawmage
Wrenn and Six
Ephemerate
Plains x20

[Actions]
