Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Tomik, Orzhov Lawmage.Cast
Bot2.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wrenn and Six.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Flourishing Grapple.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Wrenn and Six)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Tomik, Orzhov Lawmage)
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Attack(Woodland Changeling > Wrenn and Six; Ornithopter > Wrenn and Six)
Bot1.Attack(Woodland Changeling > Wrenn and Six; Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
